MID_SE_Lou_Set_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_001: Hyah-TYAH! I think that's enough for today.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_002: Nice work today, Seteth! You were really focused\nduring your training.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_003: If you don't mind my asking, that isn't an ordinary\nspear, is it? It appears to be the work of a master.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_004: Ah, you appreciate the craftsmanship?\nWell, thank you.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_005: In fact, this spear was forged by my own hand. I'm\nsomething of a professional.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_006: You made it yourself?! I had no idea you were\na skilled blacksmith too!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_007: It's simply a skill I acquired over the course of a long\nlife. It isn't too impressive, really.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_008: But you, despite your youth, have a keen eye. I find\nthat to be impressive.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_009: Who, me? Don't be silly.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_010: Yes! Actual praise! This is the best...
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_011: Plus it's from Seteth... Well-dressed, polite Seteth.\nA compliment from a bona fide gentleman...
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_012: If you have an interest in it, why not try your hand\nat smithing?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_013: I can speak to a friend on your behalf. They may be\nable to give you a beginner lesson.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_014: Hm? Beginner lessons?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_015: If you're feeling uneasy, I'll happily accompany you.\nThat is, if you don't mind. What do you think?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_016: Lessons with YOU, Seteth?!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_017: Indeed. That is my proposal.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_018: Are you planning a meeting with me later? Is this\nreally happening?! I can't wait!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_019: Apologies, but is that a yes?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_020: Of course! I'd love to go! Just the two of us together...\nHow could I not?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_021: Hm? I'm not sure I follow...
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_022: Don't worry—I promise not to be an embarrassment.\nI'll dress up and everything!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_023: I certainly don't think dressing up is a requirement\nfor a smithing class.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_024: Ooooh! I'm so excited! I'll be able to die happy\nafter this! Hehehe!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_C_025: This is a problem. I'm not sure how to proceed now...
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_001: Hraaah... YAH!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_002: Keep it up. And when you swing, use your entire\nbody, not just your arms.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_003: R-right!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_004: Thank you so much for your help, Seteth! The quality\nof this spear is a testament to your skill as a teacher.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_005: I'm still an amateur, so the fact that I could make\nsomething like this is unbelievable!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_006: I simply provided guidance. It was you who\ncreated it.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_007: You're too kind... But still, thank you!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_008: Seteth's just the best! And he's modest too, which\nmakes him even cooler!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_009: Um, Seteth? Would it be possible for you to mark\nmy spear with your name somehow?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_010: You want me to etch my name into it? But...why?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_011: To commemorate our teamwork! It's our first\ncollaboration!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_012: That's... Hm...
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_013: While her feelings are, in a way, flattering, I cannot\nreciprocate them.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_014: Carving the name of loved ones into a weapon\ncertainly imbues them with strength.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_015: That's right! You get it! So...shall we get started?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_016: Let's see here... I'll put my wife's name up top\nand my daughter's name just below that.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_017: What? You...have a family?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_018: Didn't I mention? We are apart now for various\nreasons, but they are still important to me.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_019: Of course... How could someone as wonderful as you\nnot already have a partner?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_020: *sigh*
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_021: She looks a bit heartbroken... Perhaps I overdid it.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_022: Ludia, I would, of course, be happy to continue\nour friendship.
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_023: There's still hope, Lulu! Plenty of people have more\nthan one wife—even Father! Why not Seteth?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_024: U-uh...
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_025: Seteth! Tell me how your relationship with your\nwife started?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_026: How did you meet? How did you fall in love? When\ndid you first hold hands?
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_027: Why are you asking such things? That is a\nprivate matter!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_028: It matters, alright! I want to know what kind of\nwoman can land a wonderful gentleman like you!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_029: Where was your favorite place to go out on dates?\nWhich of her outfits set your heart aflame? Tell me!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_030: I need to know how she makes you feel and what it\nis about her that makes you feel that way—in detail!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_031: Absolutely, unequivocally no! I will not answer any\nof these questions!
MID_SE_Lou_Set_B_032: Wait! No, Seteth! This is important!